Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.83,0:02:27.70,OPCNS - speak,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(150,150)\c&H000000DB\bord2\3c&H00FFFFFF}就算已死也想实现梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.83,0:02:30.16,OPCNS - speak,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(150,150)\c&H000000DB\bord2\3c&H00FFFFFF}不 就算已死也能实现梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.41,0:02:32.67,OPCNS - speak,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(150,150)\c&H000000DB\bord2\3c&H00FFFFFF}这究竟是绝望？ 还是希望？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.96,0:02:34.38,OPCNS - speak,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(150,150)\c&H000000DB\bord2\3c&H00FFFFFF}撑过无情的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.63,0:02:36.30,OPCNS - speak,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(150,150)\c&H000000DB\bord2\3c&H00FFFFFF}就算没有希望也要突进
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.63,0:02:36.30,OPCNS - speak,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(150,150)\c&H000000DB\bord2\3c&H00FFFFFF}{\an2\fs40\pos(640,105)} 脉搏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.50,0:02:38.71,OPCNS - speak,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(150,150)\c&H000000DB\bord2\3c&H00FFFFFF}因为这就是我们的佐贺！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.50,0:02:38.71,OPCNS - speak,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(150,150)\c&H000000DB\bord2\3c&H00FFFFFF}{\an2\fs40\pos(805,105)} 传奇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.42,0:02:43.93,OPCNS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}是谁在此凭吊  可我葬身远方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.10,0:02:49.68,OPCNS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}悼词划破寂静  道出我萌发的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.31,0:02:54.27,OPCNS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}许下誓言  道破天机
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.65,0:03:00.69,OPCNS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}尸骸层层堆积
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.90,0:03:04.32,OPCNS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}直到天际
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.62,0:03:10.16,OPCNS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}高声唱吧  无果之花
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.16,0:03:13.04,OPCNS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}就算成泥也不止步
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.04,0:03:16.21,OPCNS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}若有人愚弄我们无可退让的尊严
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:19.26,OPCNS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}就只管释放内心的渴望
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.26,0:03:24.18,OPCNS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}就算腐朽也不止步 方为命脉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.18,0:03:27.39,OPCNS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}向着天空呐喊  脱离生存的定义
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.39,0:03:31.10,OPCNS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)}宁可粉身碎骨  也要划破黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.10,0:03:31.35,OPCNS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)\move(640,15,640,-50,)}宁可粉身碎骨  也要划破黑暗
